sentences.text:
This revisional application has been preferred mainly on three grounds:
1) Non-compliance of Section 13(2) of the said Act of 1954;
2) Non-projection in the report of the Public Analyst how he arrived at the conclusion; and 3) That the learned Trial Court only in one question examined the accused persons under Section 313 of Cr.P.C. which has caused prejudice to the revisionists.
